//@version=5
indicator("request/security sma")
// The expression runs in a secondary context over the requested feed's own
// bars, so ta.* has that feed's history — not the chart's. ta.sma(close, 2) is
// the mean of the last two 5-minute closes. The 5-minute closes are 106, 111,
// 116, so the average is na (only one bar), then 108.5, then 113.5, each shown
// once its 5-minute bar confirms.

// Bars: 15
// Data: request_bars.csv

htf = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "5", ta.sma(close, 2))
log.info(str.tostring(htf))

// Expected output:
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// 108.5
// 108.5
// 108.5
// 108.5
// 108.5
// 113.5
